53:48.243 --> 53:51.023
♫'Cause I'm your SUN♫

675
53:51.043 --> 53:54.593
♫I'll be your sun, you'll be my sky♫

676
53:54.673 --> 53:58.513
♫I'll be your sun, you'll be my sky♫

677
53:58.533 --> 54:00.513
♫When you look up high♫

678
54:00.533 --> 54:04.323
♫The Sun will be there, shining in the sky♫

679
54:04.343 --> 54:08.673
♫'Cause I'm your SUN♫

680
54:13.683 --> 54:15.393
This Sun is much prettier.

681
54:21.593 --> 54:23.113
Won't you look a bit more?

682
54:25.653 --> 54:27.703
I've been looking at you all night.

683
54:27.733 --> 54:29.033
Let me sleep some more.

684
54:46.073 --> 54:47.073
What are you doing?

685
54:47.733 --> 54:49.213
Leaving a mark on you,

686
54:49.563 --> 54:51.593
so people know that you're mine.

687
54:53.603 --> 54:56.233
I don't want our relationship to be a secret anymore.

688
54:57.873 --> 54:58.223
[CN]

689
54:58.243 --> 54:59.543
Aren't you scared your father will find out?

690
55:01.063 --> 55:01.983
I am,

691
55:02.643 --> 55:04.713
but it's scarier if someone steals you from me.

692
55:07.993 --> 55:09.653
No one can take me away

693
55:09.723 --> 55:10.953
if I don't want to go.

694
55:19.313 --> 55:21.053
[CN]

695
55:34.823 --> 55:35.553
Chris,

696
55:36.023 --> 55:37.353
shall we have breakfast?

697
55:45.183 --> 55:46.663
It's only been one night,

698
55:46.683 --> 55:47.943
and you want to get engaged?

699
55:47.963 --> 55:49.393
Aren't you a little too easy?

700
55:49.603 --> 55:51.173
I might be,

701
55:51.193 --> 55:52.593
but only for you, Sun.

702
55:52.613 --> 55:54.033
Chris doesn't love you.

703
55:54.163 --> 55:54.993
Chris loves...

704
55:55.033 --> 55:56.473
Don't you dare say her name!

705
55:56.603 --> 55:57.793
Don't eat that cake, Sun.

706
55:57.883 --> 55:59.593
- Nan, stop! - Let go of me!

707
56:00.533 --> 56:01.313
Nadear.

708
56:01.513 --> 56:03.473
I really want us to be back together.

709
56:03.743 --> 56:04.663
Thank you

710
56:04.683 --> 56:06.723
for remembering I wanted to swim.

711
56:06.743 --> 56:07.753
Actually...

712
56:08.163 --> 56:09.773
I want to do something else as well.

713
56:23.593 --> 56:33.453
♫The rain keeps splashing beneath our cover,♫

714
56:33.473 --> 56:38.593
♫Once it was a special place for two lovers♫

715
56:38.613 --> 56:42.613
♫There was never enough room for the third♫

716
56:42.713 --> 56:48.713
♫Now, the rain soaks our hearts together♫

717
56:48.733 --> 56:58.453
♫The question that's trapped in my heart♫

718
56:58.473 --> 57:03.513
♫Maybe it's time for you to do your part♫

719
57:03.533 --> 57:07.813
♫Choose the one your heart truly desires♫

720
57:07.833 --> 57:16.473
♫Before the last raindrop falls, don't make me shed another tear♫

